<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="80deab78">This is the framework of individuals and organizational units within which a project is defined, and to whom a project
manager is accountable. The management and control structure is the body that controls the project and approves the
deliverables. This group may map directly to an existing enterprise organization, or it may be created only for the
duration of the project.</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="5d92cbdf"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="c3e47fba"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="a8f932d7"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="e364641e">&lt;p&gt;
    A formal project control organization serves two basic purposes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        It defines and delineates the roles and responsibilities of each key participant in the project
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        It defines the reporting relationships among the project participants
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="c312f5e1">It is not sufficient to merely define the project governance structure within a project charter and assume that
it is established and effective. A project governance structure needs to be created and vested with some
real power or authority.  Sponsorship must make sure that project governance has sufficient authority and credibility
for the project to realize its intended benefits. The investment of unding and resources is at risk without a project
governance structure.</attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="2c805890"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="4135b5de">&lt;p&gt;
    A project governance structure is comprised of:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Executive Sponsorship
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Project Sponsorship
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Project Management Role(s)
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="ae0931d0"></attribute>
